          "_name": "features19",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features18\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background5.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg\" mbr-class=\"{'offset-lg-1': fullWidth}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                        <b>Easy and simple</b>\n                    </h6>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">TrimRx is a telehealth weight management platform offering both GLP-1 and GLP-1+GIP compounded medications starting at $149 per month. The platform has served over 100,000 happy customers and holds a 4.8-star \"Excellent\" rating on review platforms — one of the largest patient bases in the compounded GLP-1 telehealth market. \n<br>Its headline feature is Lifetime Price Protection: you lock in today's price for life and pay the same on every dose. I'll admit “for life” is the kind of phrase that makes me want to read the terms, but the reason it's genuinely clever is that it defuses the two things that quietly erode value in this category — dose-based price creep and renewal-rate hikes — in one move, with no hidden fees and no membership. Shipping is free and arrives in 1–2 days.\n<br>trimrx also offers 0% interest financing through Affirm, Klarna, or Afterpay, making upfront costs more manageable. Medications offered are compounded (not FDA-approved name-brand products like Ozempic or Wegovy), and availability can change based on FDA shortage designations. But trimrx is a telehealth weight management program that connects adults with licensed healthcare providers to obtain prescription weight-loss medications.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://kxevku.s.gy/lY3dFp\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Start today</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/what20is20trimrx-815x728.webp\" alt=\"what-is-trimrx\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
