          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Trimrx offers 24/7 communication with your provider and care team via the patient portal.\n<br>To get started with trimrx, simply follow the steps below:<br>\n<b><br>1.Complete the online health questionnaire:</b><br>Fill out trimrx's online intake form covering your health history, BMI, weight loss goals, and current medications. This takes a few minutes.<br>\n<br><b>2.Licensed Clinician Consultation:</b><br>A licensed independent clinician reviews your intake and conducts a virtual consultation. They determine whether a compounded GLP-1 or GLP-1+GIP prescription is clinically appropriate. A prescription is not guaranteed.\n<br> \n<br><b>3.Medication shipped to you:</b><br>If a prescription is issued, a licensed compounding pharmacy prepares your medication and ships it directly to you.<br> \n<br><b>4.Ongoing Support &amp; Follow-ups:</b><br>TrimRx provides ongoing clinical follow-ups and support throughout the program. The platform has managed 100,000+ customer journeys and has established support processes.\n<br><br><b>5.Approval process:</b> <br>TrimRx requires a government-issued ID to verify the patient and start treatment. You will also need to fill out a health history intake form. Most care will be provided over asynchronous chat on the patient portal. Some patients may need to complete a video visit depending on state laws and your medical history.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
