          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">TrimRx operates using a three-entity structure that is common across telehealth platforms. Understanding who is actually involved in your care helps clarify what the platform does and does not do.<br>\n<br><b>TrimRx (MetaFit Pharma Solutions LLC)</b> functions as the telehealth platform facilitating connections between patients and healthcare providers. According to the company's published terms, TrimRx itself is not a healthcare provider. The platform provides the technology infrastructure, customer service, intake forms, and coordination that enables the telehealth experience.<br>\n<br><b>Licensed medical providers</b> are independent healthcare professionals who review patient information submitted through the TrimRx platform and determine whether prescriptions are appropriate. These providers make clinical decisions based on the health information patients provide. According to the platform's published FAQ, the company cannot guarantee that any&nbsp;individual will receive a prescription, as that determination rests entirely with the evaluating clinician.<br><br><b>Partner pharmacies</b> fulfill prescriptions written by the medical providers. According to the company, TrimRx works with licensed, U.S.-based pharmacies that meet FDA regulations and hold LegitScript certification. Compounded medications are prepared by these pharmacy partners and shipped directly to patients.<br><br><br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
